      energy districts. Although the cause is yet unknown, a hacking attack from
      a multinational terrorist organization is likely.\""
    - "\"Investigators have been dispatched to the scene, but at the moment, all
      civilians on planet Earth are ordered to stay in underground shelters.\u201D  "
